      {
        "text": "Eddy Polon has served on Burbank’s Transportation Commission since 2022. He is the commission’s vice chair. He says he co-owned a bakery for 18 years. He says he was a television writer. His campaign says he organized for the United Farm Workers. He wants to build housing near transit without displacing residents. He proposes using city land for small-lot developments and offering low-interest home loans for local workers. He supports building the North Hollywood to Pasadena bus rapid transit project without delay. He proposed part-time dedicated lanes using parking lanes during rush hour. He said the council missed a compromise by ignoring staff recommendations. He also calls for transparent budgeting and early public input.",
